{"step_index":423,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T16:42:41Z","thinking":"**Designing the Style**\n\nI'm currently focused on designing the stylesheet, specifically for `web/css/main.css`. I'm starting with a sleek palette using matte titanium and obsidian, defining a set of CSS variables in the `:root` element. The initial focus is on a dark theme, building a foundation for visual styling. I'm prioritizing readability and modern design principles.\n\n\n**Defining the Palette**\n\nI've been meticulously defining a comprehensive color palette within my `main.css`. It includes foundational neutrals like charcoal and steel gray, along with several accent colors such as blue, amber, emerald, and rose. This builds a foundation for a consistent semantic map to support background, text, and border styles. I'm focusing on crafting an aesthetic that is both functional and visually appealing.\n\n\n**Refining the Aesthetics**\n\nI'm now refining the stylesheet, making some crucial changes. I've added accent color variables for success and warning states. I've removed the radial glowing gradients from the `body`, which felt too heavy. I'm implementing new styles for the `.quick-presets-container` and `.preset-card` elements, focusing on a clean, functional design. I've also simplified the `.brand-logo` into a sleek, monochromatic typographic element.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update main.css root variables, background and typography to a refined matte titanium palette.","EndLine":85,"Instruction":"Replace root variables and base body styles with titanium/slate palette","ReplacementContent":"/* ===== SPECTRA — EXECUTIVE STEALTH & TITANIUM UI ===== */\n/* Minimalist, high-contrast, distraction-free technical design */\n\n:root {\n    /* === TITANIUM & OBSIDIAN PALETTE === */\n    --pure-black: #08090d;\n    --pure-white: #f3f4f8;\n    --charcoal: #0e0f14;\n    --steel-gray: #15171f;\n    --slate-panel: #1b1d27;\n    --silver: #e2e4ea;\n    --light-gray: #a2a5b5;\n\n    /* === ACCENTS (Muted Technical) === */\n    --accent-blue: #3b82f6;\n    --accent-blue-light: #60a5fa;\n    --accent-emerald: #10b981;\n    --accent-amber: #f59e0b;\n    --accent-rose: #f43f5e;\n    --accent-cyan: #0ea5e9;\n\n    /* === SEMANTIC MAP === */\n    --bg-primary: #090a0e;\n    --bg-secondary: #111218;\n    --bg-tertiary: #171821;\n    --bg-card: #14151e;\n    --bg-glass: rgba(13, 14, 20, 0.92);\n    --bg-glass-light: rgba(20, 21, 29, 0.75);\n    --text-primary: #f0f1f6;\n    --text-secondary: #9093a3;\n    --text-muted: #5e6172;\n    --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n    --border-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);\n    --border-glow: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.22);\n    --accent-primary: #3b82f6;\n    --accent-success: #10b981;\n    --accent-warning: #f59e0b;\n    --accent-glow: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.10);\n\n    /* === SPACING === */\n    --space-xs: 4px;\n    --space-sm: 8px;\n    --space-md: 16px;\n    --space-lg: 24px;\n    --space-xl: 32px;\n\n    /* === TYPOGRAPHY === */\n    --font-xs: 12px;\n    --font-sm: 13px;\n    --font-base: 15px;\n    --font-lg: 19px;\n    --font-xl: 22px;\n    --font-2xl: 28px;\n    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'SF Mono', 'Monaco', monospace;\n\n    /* === MOTION === */\n    --transition-fast: 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    --transition-base: 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    --radius-sm: 6px;\n    --radius-md: 9px;\n    --radius-lg: 12px;\n    --radius-pill: 999px;\n}\n\n/* ===== BASE ===== */\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--bg-primary);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n    font-size: var(--font-base);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}","StartLine":1,"TargetContent":"/* ===== AURA — PREMIUM BRANDED UI ===== */\n/* Inspired by Cluely, LockedIn AI, Linear, Vercel */\n\n:root {\n    /* === WARM-DARK PALETTE === */\n    --pure-black: #08080f;\n    --pure-white: #f0f0f5;\n    --charcoal: #0c0c14;\n    --steel-gray: #1c1c2a;\n    --silver: #e5e5e5;\n    --light-gray: #f5f5f5;\n\n    /* === BRAND ACCENTS === */\n    --accent-indigo: #6366f1;\n    --accent-violet: #8b5cf6;\n    --accent-indigo-light: #818cf8;\n    --success-green: #34d399;\n    --warning-orange: #fb923c;\n    --subtle-purple: #6366f1;\n    --electric-blue: #6366f1;\n\n    /* === SEMANTIC MAP === */\n    --bg-primary: #08080f;\n    --bg-secondary: #0f0f18;\n    --bg-tertiary: #161623;\n    --bg-glass: rgba(15, 15, 24, 0.72);\n    --bg-glass-light: rgba(22, 22, 35, 0.5);\n    --text-primary: #e8e8ed;\n    --text-secondary: #8b8b9e;\n    --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);\n    --border-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35);\n    --accent-primary: var(--accent-indigo);\n    --accent-success: var(--success-green);\n    --accent-warning: var(--warning-orange);\n    --accent-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12);\n\n    /* === SPACING === */\n    --space-xs: 4px;\n    --space-sm: 8px;\n    --space-md: 16px;\n    --space-lg: 24px;\n    --space-xl: 32px;\n\n    /* === TYPOGRAPHY === */\n    --font-xs: 12px;\n    --font-sm: 13px;\n    --font-base: 15px;\n    --font-lg: 20px;\n    --font-xl: 24px;\n    --font-2xl: 32px;\n    --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'SF Mono', 'Monaco', monospace;\n\n    /* === MOTION === */\n    --transition-fast: 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    --transition-base: 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n    --radius-sm: 6px;\n    --radius-md: 10px;\n    --radius-lg: 14px;\n    --radius-pill: 999px;\n}\n\n/* ===== BASE ===== */\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--bg-primary);\n    background-image:\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),\n        radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06) 0%, transparent 50%);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n    font-size: var(--font-base);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n}","TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web\\css\\main.css","toolAction":"Updating main.css palette variables","toolSummary":"Update main.css palette"}}]}
